#: app/Referral.php
msgid "Hejazer Kafela cookies"
msgstr ""

#: app/Referral.php
msgid "When a package or catalog page is opened with a referral code (?ref=), Hejazer Kafela stores that code in a first-party cookie named pothik_ref for 30 days. The cookie holds only the code, no personal data. When a visitor picks a language, Hejazer Kafela stores their choice (en or bn) in a cookie named pothik_lang for one year. For a signed-in user the choice is also saved in their profile."
msgstr ""

#: app/Referral.php
msgid "Hejazer Kafela inquiries"
msgstr ""

#: app/Referral.php
msgid "When a visitor sends an inquiry, Hejazer Kafela saves the name, phone, WhatsApp number, city, room share, number of pilgrims and note in the site database, and emails them to the office. To limit spam it keeps a short-lived counter per visitor address for one hour."
msgstr ""
